{"id":"aadd5778e8be785b2b9df084","source":"rvvoenkor-tg","source_name":"Operation Z Russian Spring","platform":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/RVvoenkor/123107","published_at":"2026-09-11T00:05:45Z","collected_at":"2026-09-11T01:18:07.817424Z","title":"","text":"‼️ 🇷🇺 🇮🇳 Путин прибыл в Нью-Дели на саммит БРИКС ▪️ В. Путин с 11 по 13 сентября посетит с рабочим визитом Индию, — днем заявил помощник президента Ушаков. ➖ Президент на полях саммита БРИКС в Индии проведет ряд двусторонних встреч, в том числе с премьером Индии, президентом ЮАР, премьерами Эфиопии и Малайзии, с наследным принцем Абу-Даби и главой Нового банка развития БРИКС; ➖ Путин на полях саммита БРИКС может встретиться и с президентом Египта; ➖ Основные договоренности саммита будут зафиксированы в итоговой декларации; ➖ Ушаков полагает, что премьер Индии Моди может посетить Россию с визитом в 2027 году; ➖ Товарооборот РФ и Индии в первом полугодии 2026 года вырос на 8%, отметил он; ➖ Путин может встретиться с лидером Вьетнама в ноябре на саммите АТЭС в Китае; ➖ То Лам пригласил Путина посетить Вьетнам с государственным визитом в 2027 году. ⚠️ Подписаться на RV: MAX | t.me/RVvoenkor","html":"","media":["https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/KtX0nTSmRxsG9Vgw8obX-s_EN6OMPaKNek9sMSWQekXDU3U9jY3c7-Tg_jttClgkr7NXcIPYlDi1IvzT9-l49Iwsolh33-qgayEGEfQplkYa_g3ypiiB4Uymy5BSJ_6zwmcax7pOTg7F72fNzLZfZYT214oqLvjjtIJhyTzZXWWzXs2NS6MHGpgmbApi6_1YE8bBXoLca03-vJKAdFVPjT2iOhbZggX23Mjlg1BFBcrJDtMmv4A3FNErnzMm6XVcmYEbINj4R22sLTgIs5vwQxvI4_IhAsdfjEYlKxEYVjC5AKNddSTAm4Y05TXjdIetzQJqGmRTqlFZk3tdcwwCvg"],"author":"Operation Z Russian Spring","language":"und","group":"ru-milbloggers","perspective":"russian","trust":"low","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"ba7ec4bff60c5fe59aef842d2010f7c5bd98f701650b803bebb7167bc81b2a51","original_text_chars":899,"original_html_chars":8808,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":18,"platform":{"post":"RVvoenkor/123107"}}}
{"id":"334c3b2e67068be5f87e325e","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/11/anthony-albanese-september-11-aged-care-labor-coalition-angus-taylor-one-nation-pauline-hanson-andrew-hastie-ntwnfb","published_at":"2026-09-11T01:04:08Z","collected_at":"2026-09-11T01:18:28.204671Z","title":"Australia news live: Andrew Hastie says he accepts Barnaby Joyce’s explanation over ‘traitor’ video and Pauline Hanson now ‘the only lying coward’","text":"20.54 EDT Pauline Hanson not backing away from Hastie cartoon, suggesting a ‘chill pill’ for critics The One Nation leader, Pauline Hanson , is standing by the cartoon that labelled Andrew Hastie a “traitor” despite growing condemnation from Labor, the Greens, Liberals and the crossbench. The video is currently pinned to the top of Hanson’s X feed, and she said on Wednesday she would not apologise and the uproar was “a storm in a teacup as far as I’m concerned”. She has denied ever calling Hastie a traitor. Last night, Hanson posted a photo of Jacqui Lambie and herself in the Senate, alongside a post that read “I think everyone just needs to take a chill pill”. A furious Lambie told ABC radio yesterday that Hanson was a “bloody coward”. The One Nation leader posted again this morning on X to express her “thanks” to Hastie that the “cartoons make the news again”, sharing the “ten best episodes” of the animation Please Explain. As we reported earlier, Hastie told Guardian Australia he accepted Barnaby Joyce’s explanation that he didn’t know about the cartoon. He said he now knows that Hanson “is the only lying coward”.","html":"","media":[],"author":"Nick Visser","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"4431953fa10f33478428c97d98ad1bbb8307f96ca0fbb7048e89e8b49fda05b2","original_text_chars":1134,"original_html_chars":1768,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":0,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/11/anthony-albanese-september-11-aged-care-labor-coalition-angus-taylor-one-nation-pauline-hanson-andrew-hastie-ntwnfb","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/11/anthony-albanese-september-11-aged-care-labor-coalition-angus-taylor-one-nation-pauline-hanson-andrew-hastie-ntwnfb"}}}
{"id":"af30997f48f9fb8691cea664","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/10/donald-trump-republican-midterm-convention-dividend-offer-5000-vance-latest-news-updates","published_at":"2026-09-11T00:58:03Z","collected_at":"2026-09-11T01:18:43.923243Z","title":"JD Vance to address Republican midterm convention after Trump’s $5,000 offer sparks bribery claims – live","text":"16.17 EDT Second night of GOP midterm convention begins with JD Vance set to deliver keynote address Back with his comically large gavel, Joe Gruters – the Republican National Committee chair – kicked off the second night of the GOP midterm convention. Gruters noted that today is the one year anniversary of Charlie Kirk’s death – the conservative activist and Turning Point USA founder who was shot and killed while speaking at a campus event in Utah. “He [Kirk] believed in America, in freedom, in young people’s courage to stand up and fight for the country they love. He didn’t just join a movement; he built one,” Gruters said. “Let’s honor Charlie and let’s be more like Charlie Kirk.” Later today, we’ll also hear from vice-president JD Vance , who’ll deliver the keynote address. Donald Trump will also speak again, but assured last night’s audience in Dallas that he doesn’t plan to speak for that long. “I’m going to be just sort of getting up here and saying, good luck. We love you all,” he said at the end of his nearly two-hour speech on Wednesday.","html":"","media":[],"author":"Shrai Popat (now); Chris Hippensteel, Keely Aouga and Tom Ambrose (earlier)","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"055d92943de971a68bd376c0559854cf0e52dc566c38c71c953fc4518e68fd6f","original_text_chars":1063,"original_html_chars":1733,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":0,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/10/donald-trump-republican-midterm-convention-dividend-offer-5000-vance-latest-news-updates","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/sep/10/donald-trump-republican-midterm-convention-dividend-offer-5000-vance-latest-news-updates"}}}
{"id":"5137067d4ce6dda4330d7737","source":"colonelcassad-tg","source_name":"Boris Rozhin","platform":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/boris_rozhin/225441","published_at":"2026-09-11T00:04:01Z","collected_at":"2026-09-11T01:18:06.905255Z","title":"","text":"УФСБ России по Калужской области выявлена и пресечена противоправная деятельность лица, оправдывавшего терроризм. В ходе оперативно-розыскных мероприятий установлено,что фигурант распространял в сети интернет высказывания,оправдывающие террористическую деятельность. Следственным подразделением УФСБ России по Калужской области в отношении лица возбуждено уголовное дело по Ч. 2 ст. 205.2 УК России «Публичные призывы к осуществлению террористической деятельности, публичное оправдание терроризма или пропаганда терроризма». Расследование уголовного дела продолжается. @opersvodki","html":"","media":["https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/cjLziE-dCN-dKC9eyJBjOcNy29VxFCAFtgudbCao6J0kkLSv1_nOGP5bkqWURLdCmCIFAJBVMD_92xfp6pRG4izWcwRNXjrtI3YoI4S3vDfLt9TNY3PWK6oLRD5aw-WZe7yEVlXlZAHXIUUy9cSCD8myme15N1MyHikzlTCrF9di7S9mKtpTm1Y_L1r2avwrQYNvaxQz4pJDcsrpmlkPrUN0dSy6IimR6PVTA2GpI9P0IYTl1xuDyOBVZyVzZJ1I2PuD_oKDnqZZbrtBBjopZVHaTJzu7m9Suj4rgSehbiXODwK9ydt46D4tOrwqeYr-j5BPt9byY-8GtnYL4pODmw","https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/6fffdf6996.mp4?token=uJnPVU_gdt_GkP9zWZRkgKrHB5BxdYMoiD4wu7P6xBd9o8QyFSQIJGNEn_rogSwiH7HeGxeyKaulLXY3t-tHZAF57Cbc5a7WLJY0PGpuU4b2-Gh_rdurbdJX1rKCmYl_txX6j2XsuFPUJ2ijpacH5F5lvb-2ftbiclbNFuoNuO6VKg6qbxW_zs22yUaFytzFuM1pBlmdCtYmr3h9VvEqkwFI1WHNSXz1OqqR0yKNnXgsCVhzXB3UaKLFHTO-C9UuT5srANOQCu97msGec7VfNyt-DrFeqk7QKXWKjXEyh3fRs7fmt0bEZdnnd2rhjc0qWPDLQspY3bLeeFUYm1EaLzSN3IyUb2WNoz4mp0yvuabk39zTBdRdPuqZjl6ptHBGuUDoes3okVnaGJMHbOycKDNJih9dPPPlnMGTfZR7rLyg3M6s1mzxWCNGiJ4YSV1Fi0ccAKP-csAQjCHYJT9NpiGHkJhWg0V-Uvrn2KP019SHoFfDiM9f4Pj9lOTtRhwXRouUn-oKYTUwM3Hkk5XLsixCL0c0YycswtSGCx4c82v8K66tC1JHkiuYHLjeCRl7Fl4DhtHmOvv2Dc0FfG7wBAy7PEf4Enw9UUnKnBz2qiWS4f7QtrpC3vQGGLBQ0izsqdDtXtQs9pKdtuNYFJvfO5dgrMDAply9UWAylghsi6E"],"author":"Boris Rozhin","language